			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[The Thandol Span is the great bridge at the northern edge of the {link:wetlands}Wetlands{/link}. It crosses a deep gorge to the {link:arathi-highlands}Arathi Highlands{/link} and carries the main road between Khaz Modan and the northern lands. The {link:dark-iron-dwarves}Dark Irons{/link} blew apart its western bridge in an ambush, and many dwarves died with it, among them the brother of {link:longbraid-the-grim}Longbraid the Grim{/link}. The plan was laid by a Dark Iron called {link:kam-deepfury}Kam Deepfury{/link}. His agents hid more explosives across the gorge to bring down what was left. If the Span falls, the dwarves lose their chief supply line to the north.]=],
		},
	},
