			text = [=[Thelgen Rock is a cave in the hills of the southern {link:wetlands}Wetlands{/link}, south-east of {link:prospector-whelgar}Whelgar{/link}'s dig. Spiders fill it, and their venom is strong enough that the alchemists of Menethil need their unbroken glands to make antivenom. A great spider called the Leech Widow hunts near its mouth. The path past Thelgen Rock climbs into the highlands where the {link:excavation-site}Excavation Site{/link} lies.]=],
		},
	},
})

