			text = [=[Fitzsimmons was first mate of the {i}Wave Mistress{/i}, a ship of the line in the {link:third-fleet}Third Fleet{/link} of {link:kul-tiras}Kul Tiras{/link}. On the fleet's last voyage, red dragons ridden by orcs fell upon it and burned it off the coast of the {link:wetlands}Wetlands{/link}. He alone lived. Now he spends his days in the Deepwater Tavern, sour-smelling and thirsty, and his nights dreaming of his drowned brothers.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Significance",
			text = [=[Fitzsimmons is the living memory of {link:third-fleet}the Doomed Fleet{/link}. Only he knows that something terrible was hidden aboard one of its ships, and that its power keeps the dead from resting.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Deeds",
			text = [=[• He tells the tale of the {link:third-fleet}Third Fleet{/link} to anyone who buys him mead.
• He asks for his cursed brothers to be set free.
• He sends seekers to the ghost of {link:captain-halyndor}Captain Halyndor{/link} for the key to the ship's strongbox.
• He points the way to the Greenwarden, and warns the seeker not to go.]=],
		},
